<!--
    Android lint for :androidApp (plan 03 §19.5, plan 16 §2.2). abortOnError = true and no baseline come from the
    oc.android.application convention (build-logic LintPolicy.kt, which applies the same table to every module).
    :quality:secTest LintTableTest keeps this file, LintPolicy.kt and plan 16 §2.2 equal. Suppress one use in code with
    @SuppressLint and a reason comment (KitWebPreview.kt SetJavaScriptEnabled; PackageInstallerUpdater API 26-27
    PackageManagerGetSignatures), never by path here. Owner: S1-SECGATES.
-->
